                    {
                        "sense_id": "909c7db0-263b-39ca-932b-f483c882f3bf",
                        "entry_id": "298ffc79-a7db-356c-8fa0-c4079dbb12e2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Caper, frisking, often with a nuance of flirtation. (of a person)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b9a51ec-a40e-4a1b-87af-4cdbc0484dc9",
                                "sense_id": "909c7db0-263b-39ca-932b-f483c882f3bf",
                                "text": "One humiliation had succeeded another—the false smiles of the market sellers, the curvetings and oglings of the barmaids with whom his father flirted, the compliments and encouraging words of his father's friends."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3acdf24b-b4b0-404c-a638-02f602634c10",
                                "sense_id": "909c7db0-263b-39ca-932b-f483c882f3bf",
                                "text": "And when they were back again going through the figure, they made a real pantomime of it, with coquettish smiles and curvettings on her part, roguish glances and bold advances on his."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
